  form what = "A projector", shape = owned, system = crm
| at               | event              | by    | -> stage | status      |
| 2026-11-16 10:00 | submit             | e1101 | middle   | in progress |
| 2026-11-16 11:00 | edit(system: wiki) | e1001 | middle   | in progress |
| 2026-11-16 12:00 | approve            | e1001 | first    | in progress |
| 2026-11-16 13:00 | approve            | e3101 | second   | in progress |
| 2026-11-16 14:00 | approve            | e7001 | decide   | in progress |

