| at               | event   | by    | -> stage | status      |
| 2026-12-28 10:00 | submit  | e1201 | second   | in progress |
| 2026-12-28 11:00 | approve | e1101 | second   | in progress |
| 2026-12-28 12:00 | approve | e1101 | decide   | in progress |
